\newlabel{expAB}{{1}{2}{Schematic representation of the experimental setup. A charged point particle propagates from an initial spacetime point $(t_a, x_a)$ to a final point $(t_b, x_b)$, passing through two slits, $S_1$ and $S_2$. An infinite solenoid, which produces a constant magnetic field $\boldsymbol {B}$ strictly confined within a cylindrical region $\mathcal {D}$}{figure.caption.2}{}}
